.page-section.p-120-cont.cg-section.clearfix(id="services-link")
    .container
        .row
            .col-md-10.col-md-offset-1.text-center.mb-60
                h2.cg-section-title Services
                p.cg-section-lead Productized backend engagements—clear scope, senior execution, AI-assisted delivery. No generic app-studio retainers.
        .row
            .col-md-6
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='200ms')
                    h3 AWS cost optimization audit
                    ul
                        li Baseline spend and find waste in compute, Lambda, API Gateway, networking, and storage—including AI/inference workloads when they are on the bill
                        li AI-assisted inventory and pattern matching across accounts, reviewed by engineers before recommendations ship
                        li Prioritized savings plan with guardrails so gains hold as traffic and model usage grow
                    a.cg-offer-link(href="#quote-request") Get an AWS cost analysis →
            .col-md-6
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='300ms')
                    h3 Backend performance engineering
                    ul
                        li Trace production bottlenecks in APIs, workers, and AI call paths
                        li Tune Go services and distributed workflows under real load
                        li Improve latency and reliability—AI accelerates analysis; engineers own the fix
                    a.cg-offer-link(href="#quote-request") Book a performance audit →
        .row
            .col-md-6
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='400ms')
                    h3 Serverless migration
                    ul
                        li Design event-driven boundaries for the right workloads
                        li Move suitable surfaces to AWS Lambda with clear cutover plans
                        li AI-assisted refactor scaffolding and test gaps, with human review before production
                    a.cg-offer-link(href="#quote-request") Request a systems review →
            .col-md-6
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='500ms')
                    h3 AI systems integration
                    ul
                        li Wire LLMs and inference into existing Go/Lambda/event-driven backends
                        li Design queues, retries, and timeouts so AI features do not block core product paths
                        li Cost and latency budgets for Bedrock and related AWS AI services—operated like the rest of your stack
                    a.cg-offer-link(href="#quote-request") Talk about AI integration →
